OL,3,AVideo game Cyberpunk 2077 to get
OL,4,Alive-action movie adaptation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA live-action movie version of smash
OL,7,Fhit video game Cyberpunk 2077 is being
OL,8,Fdeveloped by Paramount Pictures.
OL,10,FThe Hollywood studio is working with
OL,11,Fproducer Lorenzo di Bonaventura, known
OL,12,Ffor his work on the Transformers films,
OL,13,Fand CD Projekt Red (CDPR), the
OL,14,Fdeveloper of the sci-fi role-playing
OL,15,Fgame.
OL,17,FCDPR's joint-chief executive MichaEB
OL,18,FNowakowski said in a statement the
OL,19,Fcompany was "excited about Paramount as
OL,20,Fa future partner who shares our
OL,21,Fcreative ambitions for the Cyberpunk
OL,22,Ffranchise".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
